- **Breakfast:** Banana chia pudding (Paradice 9, makes 7 servings, 10 min prep)
- **Salad:** Coleslaw (Paradice 9, makes 8-10 servings, 5 min prep)
- **Protein:**Teryaki salmon (air fryer, makes 6-8 servings)
- **Side:** Honey glazed carrots (oven, makes 6 servings)

